<title>HONG KONG: Liu Chong Hing mandates US$80 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Liu Chong Hing mandates US$80 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liu Chong Hing Bank has mandated Citicorp International to arrange a US$80 million floating rate certificates of deposit issue, the arranger said on Monday.</p>
<p>The certificates will carry a maturity of five years with a put option in year three. They will pay a margin of 40 basis points over the London Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>Fees were not disclosed.</p>
<p>General syndication is expected soon.</p>
<p>Last August, Liu Chong Hing Bank completed a HK$500 million five-year floating rate certificates of deposit issue with put and call options in years three and four.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
